[[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Position the flywheel lock to stop the rotation of the crankshaft.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/770.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Code</p></th><th><p>Function</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td><p>1.860.846.000</p></td><td><p>Flywheel lock</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the fixing bolts (2a) and remove the flywheel (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/731.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the flywheel in the housing in the crankshaft.</p><p>- Screw in the fixing bolts and then tighten them to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/774.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Value - daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>Bolts</p></td><td><p>FLYWHEEL (MECH.)</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td></tr></table></div><p>- Remove the flywheel lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/770.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Code</p></th><th><p>Function</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td><p>1.860.846.000</p></td><td><p>Flywheel lock</p></td></tr></table></div>"]]